project_brief:
The Applicant, 420 Kent Av420 Kent Avenue as built SPW is in zoning non-compliance and requires the following action:
1.	An authorization pursuant to ZR Sec. 62-822 (a)(2) to authorize the reduction in minimum dimensions or area in a waterfront public access area (WPAA);
2.	A new Chair Certification pursuant to ZR Sec. 62-811 to certify compliance with waterfront zoning;
3.	Conforming non-compliant planters in Phase 1;
4.	Possible legalization of the encroachment on City owned underwater lands.
